Subject: Make shifty bits work better

right now < and > will move the cards to different columns but then we lose focus. We should still be able to track which card needs to have focus.

We can also improve the event handler to where moving the card only has to update the two columns, instead of all of them, with the `mutate_reactive` bit.


It would probably look something like:

```
src_col.mutate_reactive(Column.tasks)
dst_col.mutate_reactive(Column.tasks)
```